================================================================================
Why Dual Licensing?
================================================================================

The eBPF programs are loaded into the Linux kernel and use kernel helper
functions that require GPL-compatible licensing. The user-space Go code
communicates with the kernel via system calls and can use a more permissive
license.

This approach is common in the eBPF ecosystem, used by projects like Cilium,
Katran, and others.
